      {
        "handle": "docs/architecture/APPENDIX-P-rust-public-boundary-interfaces.md:12",
        "quote": "authority, scope, effect, privacy, ordering and receipt fields are never silently defaulted;"
      },
      {
        "handle": "docs/architecture/APPENDIX-P-rust-public-boundary-interfaces.md:13",
        "quote": "closed control variants fail when unknown; additive reason/telemetry values preserve Unknown(raw);"
      },
      {
        "handle": "docs/architecture/I05-16-common-durable-fields.md:46",
        "quote": "Fields that do not apply remain explicit `None`; they are not silently omitted from the semantic model."
      },
      {
        "handle": "docs/architecture/I07-20-agent-facing-error-contract.md:24-26",
        "quote": "state/conflict — STALE_STATE_FENCE, STALE_AUTHORITY_EPOCH, STALE_PROJECTION, OBSERVATION_GAP, SCOPE_CONFLICT, CONFLICT_OPEN, CRITICAL_ATTENTION_OPEN, SEQUENCE_GAP_OPEN, TRANSITION_DIGEST_MISMATCH, AMBIGUOUS_RESULT, DESCENDANT_CLOSURE_INCOMPLETE;"
      },
      {
        "handle": "docs/architecture/I07-20-agent-facing-error-contract.md:42-46",
        "quote": "instrument/evidence — INSTRUMENT_UNAVAILABLE, INSTRUMENT_FAILED, INSTRUMENT_PARSER_INCOMPATIBLE, INSTRUMENT_EVIDENCE_INCOMPLETE, INSTRUMENT_OUTPUT_TRUNCATED, PROCESS_TREE_CLEANUP_FAILED,"
      },
      {
        "handle": "docs/architecture/I07-20-agent-facing-error-contract.md:24-46",
        "quote": "The registry carries `DESCENDANT_CLOSURE_INCOMPLETE` under state/conflict and `PROCESS_TREE_CLEANUP_FAILED` under instrument/evidence, which is why an untrusted descendant capture and a proven incomplete one are two different facts and not one boolean."
      }
    ]
  },
